{
 "title": "阅读限时训练",
 "html": "<div>\n  <div>\n    <h1>阅读程序 · 限时提速训练</h1>\n    <div>\n      <span><span>所属模块</span> 初赛深化</span><span><span>题型</span> 阅读程序（约 40 分）</span><span><span>目标</span> 练“会但慢”的题</span><span><span>难度</span> <span>★★★★☆</span></span><span><span>必练指数</span> ★★★★</span>    </div>\n\n    <div>\n      <span>点「开始计时」后用草稿纸手算，做完点「交卷并看解析」，系统记录用时与得分。</span>\n    </div>\n    <div>\n      <span>⏱ 计时：<b id=\"rtClock\">00:00</b></span>\n      \n      \n      \n    </div>\n\n    <div id=\"rtBox\">\n    <h2 id=\"p1\">阅读程序（一）· 各位数字之和</h2>\n    <div><div><span>C++</span></div><div><table><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td><span>int s=0, t=n;</span></td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td><span>while(t){ s += t % 10; t /= 10; }</span></td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td><span>cout &lt;&lt; s;</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>    <div><div>若输入 n = 123，程序输出？</div><div><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"quiz_rt1\" value=\"0\"><span>A</span><span>6</span></label><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"quiz_rt1\" value=\"1\"><span>B</span><span>5</span></label><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"quiz_rt1\" value=\"2\"><span>C</span><span>3</span></label><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"quiz_rt1\" value=\"3\"><span>D</span><span>123</span></label></div><div><span></span></div><div hidden><div>✅ 正确答案：<b>A</b></div><div>1+2+3 = <b>6</b>。每次取末位 t%10 累加后去掉末位。</div><div></div></div></div><div><div>该程序的时间复杂度约为？</div><div><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"quiz_rt2\" value=\"0\"><span>A</span><span>O(log₁₀n)（位数）</span></label><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"quiz_rt2\" value=\"1\"><span>B</span><span>O(n)</span></label><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"quiz_rt2\" value=\"2\"><span>C</span><span>O(n²)</span></label><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"quiz_rt2\" value=\"3\"><span>D</span><span>O(1)</span></label></div><div><span></span></div><div hidden><div>✅ 正确答案：<b>A</b></div><div>循环次数 = n 的十进制位数，约 <b>O(log₁₀n)</b>。</div><div></div></div></div>\n    <h2 id=\"p2\">阅读程序（二）· 递归阶乘</h2>\n    <div><div><span>C++</span></div><div><table><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td><span>int f(int n){ return n&lt;=1 ? 1 : n * f(n-1); }</span></td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td><span>cout &lt;&lt; f(5);</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>    <div><div>程序输出 f(5) 的值是？</div><div><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"quiz_rt3\" value=\"0\"><span>A</span><span>120</span></label><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"quiz_rt3\" value=\"1\"><span>B</span><span>24</span></label><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"quiz_rt3\" value=\"2\"><span>C</span><span>60</span></label><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"quiz_rt3\" value=\"3\"><span>D</span><span>1</span></label></div><div><span></span></div><div hidden><div>✅ 正确答案：<b>A</b></div><div>5! = 5·4·3·2·1 = <b>120</b>。</div><div></div></div></div><div><div>该递归版本的时间复杂度约为？</div><div><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"quiz_rt4\" value=\"0\"><span>A</span><span>O(n)</span></label><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"quiz_rt4\" value=\"1\"><span>B</span><span>O(2ⁿ)</span></label><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"quiz_rt4\" value=\"2\"><span>C</span><span>O(n²)</span></label><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"quiz_rt4\" value=\"3\"><span>D</span><span>O(log n)</span></label></div><div><span></span></div><div hidden><div>✅ 正确答案：<b>A</b></div><div>递归深度 n，每层常数操作，复杂度 <b>O(n)</b>。</div><div></div></div></div>\n    <h2 id=\"p3\">阅读程序（三）· 数组区间累加</h2>\n    <div><div><span>C++</span></div><div><table><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td><span>int a[]={1,3,5,7,9};</span></td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td><span>int s=0;</span></td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td><span>for(int i=1;i&lt;=3;i++) s += a[i];</span></td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td><span>cout &lt;&lt; s;</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>    <div><div>程序输出？</div><div><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"quiz_rt5\" value=\"0\"><span>A</span><span>15</span></label><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"quiz_rt5\" value=\"1\"><span>B</span><span>25</span></label><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"quiz_rt5\" value=\"2\"><span>C</span><span>9</span></label><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"quiz_rt5\" value=\"3\"><span>D</span><span>21</span></label></div><div><span></span></div><div hidden><div>✅ 正确答案：<b>A</b></div><div>a[1]+a[2]+a[3] = 3+5+7 = <b>15</b>（注意下标从 0 开始）。</div><div></div></div></div><div><div>若把 i&lt;=3 改成 i&lt;=4，输出？</div><div><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"quiz_rt6\" value=\"0\"><span>A</span><span>24</span></label><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"quiz_rt6\" value=\"1\"><span>B</span><span>15</span></label><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"quiz_rt6\" value=\"2\"><span>C</span><span>25</span></label><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"quiz_rt6\" value=\"3\"><span>D</span><span>34</span></label></div><div><span></span></div><div hidden><div>✅ 正确答案：<b>A</b></div><div>多累加 a[4]=9，得 3+5+7+9 = <b>24</b>。</div><div></div></div></div>\n    <h2 id=\"p4\">阅读程序（四）· 质数判断</h2>\n    <div><div><span>C++</span></div><div><table><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td><span>int n=29, f=1;</span></td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td><span>for(int i=2;i*i&lt;=n;i++) if(n%i==0) f=0;</span></td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td><span>cout &lt;&lt; f;</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>    <div><div>n=29 时程序输出？</div><div><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"quiz_rt7\" value=\"0\"><span>A</span><span>1（是质数）</span></label><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"quiz_rt7\" value=\"1\"><span>B</span><span>0（不是）</span></label><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"quiz_rt7\" value=\"2\"><span>C</span><span>29</span></label><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"quiz_rt7\" value=\"3\"><span>D</span><span>编译错误</span></label></div><div><span></span></div><div hidden><div>✅ 正确答案：<b>A</b></div><div>29 不能被 2..5 整除，f 保持 1，输出 <b>1</b> 表示质数。</div><div></div></div></div><div><div>该程序的功能是？</div><div><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"quiz_rt8\" value=\"0\"><span>A</span><span>判断 n 是否为质数</span></label><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"quiz_rt8\" value=\"1\"><span>B</span><span>求 n 的因子和</span></label><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"quiz_rt8\" value=\"2\"><span>C</span><span>求 n 的平方根</span></label><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"quiz_rt8\" value=\"3\"><span>D</span><span>求 n 的位数</span></label></div><div><span></span></div><div hidden><div>✅ 正确答案：<b>A</b></div><div>试除到 √n，若无因子则 f=1，功能为<b>质数判断</b>。</div><div></div></div></div>\n    </div><!-- /rtBox -->\n    <div id=\"rtReport\"></div>\n\n    \n  </div>\n    <div>\n    <div id=\"toc\"></div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div><h2 id=\"quiz\">📝 本节自测<span>共 6 题</span></h2><p>做完点「提交本节自测」即时判分；单选 / 多选 / 填空混合，答错可一键收入错题本。</p><div id=\"selfQuizBox\"><div><div>关于初赛，正确的认识有？（多选） <span>多选题</span> <span>难</span></div><div><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"quiz_ppr16[]\" value=\"0\"><span>A</span><span>选择题错选会倒扣分数</span></label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"quiz_ppr16[]\" value=\"1\"><span>B</span><span>阅读程序分值高需重点练</span></label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"quiz_ppr16[]\" value=\"2\"><span>C</span><span>带计算器进考场更高效</span></label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"quiz_ppr16[]\" value=\"3\"><span>D</span><span>复赛才考编程，初赛不考</span></label></div><div><span></span></div><div hidden><div>✅ 正确答案：<b>ABD</b></div><div>错选倒扣、阅读程序占比高都是事实；<b>计算器通常不允许</b>，复赛才动手编程。</div><div></div></div></div><div><div>阅读程序写结果题，常用的分析方法有？（多选） <span>多选题</span> <span>中</span></div><div><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"quiz_ppr7[]\" value=\"0\"><span>A</span><span>列变量追踪表</span></label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"quiz_ppr7[]\" value=\"1\"><span>B</span><span>手算小样例验证</span></label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"quiz_ppr7[]\" value=\"2\"><span>C</span><span>数学归纳找规律</span></label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"quiz_ppr7[]\" value=\"3\"><span>D</span><span>凭感觉乱猜</span></label></div><div><span></span></div><div hidden><div>✅ 正确答案：<b>ABC</b></div><div>追踪表 + 小样例 + 归纳规律是稳妥三板斧。</div><div></div></div></div><div><div>提高阅读程序正确率的做法有？（多选） <span>多选题</span> <span>中</span></div><div><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"quiz_ppr13[]\" value=\"0\"><span>A</span><span>关注循环边界与执行次数</span></label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"quiz_ppr13[]\" value=\"1\"><span>B</span><span>留意取模与整除陷阱</span></label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"quiz_ppr13[]\" value=\"2\"><span>C</span><span>注意变量是否重名/覆盖</span></label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"quiz_ppr13[]\" value=\"3\"><span>D</span><span>跳过所有注释</span></label></div><div><span></span></div><div hidden><div>✅ 正确答案：<b>ABC</b></div><div>边界、整除、变量覆盖是高频坑；注释往往提示思路。</div><div></div></div></div><div><div>CSP 初赛选择题“错选”通常会倒扣 ____ 分（以当年题面为准）。（填空） <span>填空题</span> <span>易</span></div><div><input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"输入答案（如 8 / 八）\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\"></div><div><span></span></div><div hidden><div>✅ 正确答案：<b>0.5</b></div><div>典型规则：<b>错选扣 0.5、不选 0 分</b>；务必看清当年题面。</div><div></div></div></div><div><div>下列哪些属于 CSP 初赛三大题型？（多选） <span>多选题</span> <span>中</span></div><div><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"quiz_ppr10[]\" value=\"0\"><span>A</span><span>单项选择题</span></label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"quiz_ppr10[]\" value=\"1\"><span>B</span><span>阅读程序写结果</span></label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"quiz_ppr10[]\" value=\"2\"><span>C</span><span>完善程序</span></label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"quiz_ppr10[]\" value=\"3\"><span>D</span><span>听力题</span></label></div><div><span></span></div><div hidden><div>✅ 正确答案：<b>ABC</b></div><div>初赛三大题型：<b>单选 / 阅读程序 / 完善程序</b>。</div><div></div></div></div><div><div>CSP 初赛（普及/提高）满分通常为 ____ 分。（填空） <span>填空题</span> <span>易</span></div><div><input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"输入答案（如 8 / 八）\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\"></div><div><span></span></div><div hidden><div>✅ 正确答案：<b>100</b></div><div>初赛满分一般为 <b>100 分</b>。</div><div></div></div></div></div><div></div><div id=\"selfReport\"></div></div><div><div><a href=\"read_speedcard.php\"><div>← 上一题</div><div>阅读程序秒杀速查卡</div></a><a href=\"fill_framework.php\"><div>下一题 →</div><div>完善代码填空框架库</div></a></div></div><div><div><h3>🔗 相关考点推荐</h3><div><a href=\"../../knowledge/paper/